  "title": "Quenched Ukrainian Cheese Gratin",
  "description": "A sweet and pull‑friendly Ukrainian gratin with Thai chili jam, confit tomato and Ayurvedic‑friendly ingredients.",
  "cuisine": "Ukrainian",
