  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 200C.",
    "Grease a 20cm baking dish with butter.",
    "In a bowl mix the curd cheese, shredded cheddar, honey, salt, pepper, milk and egg until smooth.",
    "Fold in the Thai chili jam and confit tomato.",
    "Spread the mixture evenly in the dish.",
    "Dot the top with small butter pats.",
    "Bake for 18 minutes until the top is golden and the center is set.",
    "Remove from oven and let rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot with a side of fresh herbs.",
    "Enjoy the sweet, cheese‑pull experience."
